                                                                "terskel"@no.
geonames:U.SLPU a geonames:Code;
                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "the slope seaward from the shelf edge to the beginning of a continental rise or the point where there is a general reduction in slope"@en,
